WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,630
That's it

2
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:02,160
I'm the owner of a fitness gym

3
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,120
We are currently doing activities to attract new customers

4
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,360
We rented a space underneath the store

5
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,920
Perform some fitness equipment and movements

6
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,880
The main reason is to attract more people. I see you are so powerful and have such a strong body.

7
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,480
You can be our model and coach

8
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,600
How do you say salary?

9
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:17,580
How long do you want to set a price for, half a day? Two thousand yuan is fine.

10
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,180
If you have a phone number for two thousand yuan, let’s leave a phone number.

11
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,700
Just come and find me then.

12
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,620
Remember tomorrow

13
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,260
You should come over tomorrow around nine o'clock

14
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,380
I need to give you a good change of clothes.

15
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,860
No problem

16
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,310
wait a moment

17
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:29,670
You tell him not to make any noise here in the future.

18
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:30,790
Did you hear that?

19
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,470
Your parents asked me to take you out to work

20
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,870
It’s for you to make money here even if you can’t make any money

21
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,950
You can't be disliked by others, right? If this happens again,

22
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:39,910
I asked you to go back and stay out of here, Brother Long.

23
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:41,270
We don't dare anymore

24
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:42,870
You see he doesn’t dare anymore

25
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:44,070
This will happen again in the future

26
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,150
Come to me anytime

27
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:50,050
I will definitely deal with his parents

28
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:52,410
Do you think it’s useful to say that I’m good-looking? It’s really useful.

29
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:53,850
You see, I can earn two thousand in half a day.

30
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,370
Higher than my salary

31
00:00:55,370 --> 00:00:57,410
Oops, eat, eat, come on, come on, eat
